      "content": "but it doesn't feel weightless to me. it feels like a relief to think about. if the choice is neutral, then choosing to end it isn't \"wrong\" or \"bad\"—it's just choosing a different state. if the outcome is essentially the same, then why is there such a huge stigma against just... opting out? it seems like people just ignore the logic because they're afraid.",
